# Runtime build context (Dockerfile). Whitelist: everything is excluded,
# then only what the runtime image needs is re-included.
# Excluded by construction: tests (test_*.py, pytest.ini, requirements-dev.txt),
# .git, .github, .env*, __pycache__, *.pyc, .pytest_cache, venv/, *.log,
# archives (*.tar*, *.zip), docs, CI and compose files, IDE folders (.idea, .vscode).
*

!app.py
!requirements.txt

# Safety net in case a re-included path ever matches these
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
